  practice: "In Level 27, perform the objective \u2018Protection Diode Forward\u2019
    in the actual game laboratory. Compare fresh evidence against: Confirm the diode
    is forward biased. voltage \u2265 0.45 V. voltage \u2264 1 V. Connection pair
